<title>FRANCE: Pechiney H1 net income falls.</title>
<headline>Pechiney H1 net income falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income				     426  vs	     658</p>
<p>    Net income per share (francs)	   5.49  vs	   11.85</p>
<p>    Turnover				    32,909  vs	  36,125</p>
<p>    Net financial expenses		     542  vs	     940</p>
<p>    Taxes					    346  vs	     352</p>
<p>    Cashflow			  negative  9.46  vs		NA</p>
<p>    Earnings from operations		 1,468  vs	   1,980</p>
<p>    Income from operations		   1,297  vs	   1,867</p>
<p>    Net debt				    15,772  vs	  24,480</p>
<p>NOTE - Aluminium and packaging giant Pechiney gave the results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
